  "details": "Am using an index with gesture locking. and to make it intuitive to grab objects like swords or items off of the body. i use a contact and the gesture 1 (fist) on the index controllers to grab that object. but ive been having some glitches where it automatically grabs the object near the contact, with gestures still locked down to off and not on gesture 1 (fist). \nmy proposed fix that might help with that. is give people the ability to access the \"gesture lock\" as a bool in the animator. So there is an extra measure to stop those kinds of things. Since it isnt listed on the website at this current moment.\ni haven't found out if its something to do with the network that for 1 frame forgets its locked, or something else is at play. If i find it ill also post that here.",
